NNAAMMEE
     kkbbddmmaapp, vviiddffoonntt — system video console keyboard map/font dialog utilities

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     kkbbddmmaapp [--KK] [--VV] [--dd | --ddeeffaauulltt] [--hh | --hheellpp] [--ll | --llaanngg _l_a_n_g_u_a_g_e]
            [--pp | --pprriinntt] [--rr | --rreessttoorree] [--ss | --sshhooww] [--vv | --vveerrbboossee]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The kkbbddmmaapp utility allows easy setting of available keymaps.  The vviiddffoonntt
     command allows the setting of fonts.  Both examine a database for the
     keymaps and fonts.  Descriptions are in English by default, but may also
     be in other languages.  These programs are interactive and expect to run
     in a terminal to get required input (e.g., a keymap selection) from the
     user.

     It is strongly recommended to not choose MSDOS codepage keymaps or fonts.
     Use the ISO standard version if available!  X11 does not support MSDOS
     codepage.

     The following options are available:

     --KK      Run as command kkbbddmmaapp.

     --VV      Run as command vviiddffoonntt.

     --dd, --ddeeffaauulltt
             Use default language.  Ignore LANG environment variable.

     --hh, --hheellpp
             Print options and exit.

     --ll, --llaanngg _l_a_n_g_u_a_g_e
             Use _l_a_n_g_u_a_g_e for description and menu.

     --pp, --pprriinntt
             Print description of available keymaps or fonts to stdout and
             exit.

     --rr, --rreessttoorree
             Load default font from _/_e_t_c_/_r_c_._c_o_n_f.

     --ss, --sshhooww
             Show currently supported languages and exit.

     --vv, --vveerrbboossee
             More warnings.

EENNVVIIRROONNMMEENNTT
     LANG  preferred language

FFIILLEESS
     /usr/share/syscons/keymaps/INDEX.keymaps
     /usr/share/vt/keymaps/INDEX.keymaps       database for keymaps
     /usr/share/syscons/fonts/INDEX.fonts
     /usr/share/vt/fonts/INDEX.fonts           database for fonts
     /etc/rc.conf                              default font
     /usr/local/share/locale/locale.alias      describe common LANG values

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     dialog(1), kbdcontrol(1), vidcontrol(1), syscons(4), vt(4), kbdmap(5),
     rc.conf(5)

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The kkbbddmmaapp and vviiddffoonntt commands appeared in FreeBSD 2.1.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     Wolfram Schneider <_w_o_s_c_h_@_F_r_e_e_B_S_D_._o_r_g> wrote the original Perl version.
     The current version was rewritten in C by Jonathan Belson
